                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its not platformer, damn it, its a runner! Plain port from smart phones with one button control , video and screenshots with description gave me wrong impression that this game is somethings like recent Rayman Origin and Cuphead. Lazy devs could have actually tweaked gameplay and controls to make character fully controllable like a normal platformed, but they did not... shame, this game has potential, i like visual style, but this runner\\clicker gameplay is awful! its not an iphone! Do you hear me devs?",
